    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564">

                <pb facs="0622" n="608" sameAs="frus:frus1942v06/pg608"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711F.1914/473: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Panama</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Panamá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-05-08T16:00:00-05:00">May 8, 1942—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 7:51 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>455. Reference defense site agreement. In view of time required for preparation
                    of Panamanian statement and of memorandum annexed to agreement describing the
                    defense sites we have decided to set the date for signing the agreement and
                    releasing the statement on Wednesday May 13 at noon Panamanian time. Will it be
                    agreeable <pb facs="0623" n="609" xml:id="pg609"/> to the Department to issue
                    the statement in Washington at the same time?</p>
                <p>Reference my 449, May 7, 4 p.m.<anchor n="39" xml:id="d564-f1"/> The Panamanian
                    Government intends to make public the text of the defense site agreement
                    together with the statement which in addition to describing the negotiations
                    will give the substance of the twelve points agreement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
